{"suttaId":"tha-ap25","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[2837,2922],"vripara":"106"},"segments":{"tha-ap25:0.3":"Tisaraṇagamaniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap25:1.1":"“Nagare candavatiyā [bandhumatiyā (aṭṭha.)], mātuupaṭṭhāko [mātupaṭṭhāyako (sī.), mātupaṭṭhānako (syā.)] ahuṃ;","tha-ap25:1.3":"Andhā mātā pitā mayhaṃ, te posemi ahaṃ tadā.","tha-ap25:2.1":"“Rahogato nisīditvā, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap25:2.3":"Posento mātāpitaro, pabbajjaṃ na labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap25:3.1":"“Mahandhakārapihitā [tamandhakārapihitā (syā.)], tividhaggīhi ḍayhare;","tha-ap25:3.3":"Etādise bhave [bhaye (sī.)] jāte, natthi koci vināyako.","tha-ap25:4.1":"“Buddho loke samuppanno, dippati [dibbati (ka.)][jinasāsanaṃ (sī.)] dāni sāsanaṃ;","tha-ap25:4.3":"Sakkā uddharituṃ attā, puññakāmena jantunā.","tha-ap25:5.1":"“Uggayha tīṇi saraṇe, paripuṇṇāni gopayiṃ;","tha-ap25:5.3":"Tena kammena sukatena, paṭimokkhāmi duggatiṃ.","tha-ap25:6.1":"“Nisabho nāma samaṇo, buddhassa aggasāvako;","tha-ap25:6.3":"Tamahaṃ upagantvāna, saraṇagamanaṃ gahiṃ.","tha-ap25:7.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap25:7.3":"Tāvatā saraṇagamanaṃ, paripuṇṇaṃ agopayiṃ.","tha-ap25:8.1":"“Carime vattamānamhi, saraṇaṃ taṃ anussariṃ;","tha-ap25:8.3":"Tena kammena sukatena, tāvatiṃsaṃ agacchahaṃ.","tha-ap25:9.1":"“Devalokagato santo, puññakammasamāhito;","tha-ap25:9.3":"Yaṃ desaṃ [yaṃ yaṃ desaṃ (syā.)] upapajjāmi [upagacchāmi (sī.)], aṭṭha hetū labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap25:10.1":"“Disāsu pūjito homi, tikkhapañño bhavāmahaṃ;","tha-ap25:10.3":"Sabbe devānuvattanti, amitabhogaṃ labhāmahaṃ.","tha-ap25:11.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇo sabbattha, paṭikanto bhavāmahaṃ;","tha-ap25:11.3":"Mittānaṃ acalo homi, yaso abbhuggato mamaṃ.","tha-ap25:12.1":"“Asītikkhattu devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap25:12.3":"Dibbasukhaṃ anubhaviṃ, accharāhi purakkhato.","tha-ap25:13.1":"“Pañcasattatikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap25:13.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap25:14.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, puññakammasamāhito;","tha-ap25:14.3":"Pure sāvatthiyaṃ jāto, mahāsāle suaḍḍhake.","tha-ap25:15.1":"“Nagarā nikkhamitvāna, dārakehi purakkhato;","tha-ap25:15.3":"Hasakhiḍḍasamaṅgīhaṃ [sāhaṃ khiḍḍasamaṅgī (syā.)], saṅghārāmaṃ upāgamiṃ.","tha-ap25:16.1":"“Tatthaddasāsiṃ [tatthaddasāhaṃ (ka.)] samaṇaṃ, vippamuttaṃ nirūpadhiṃ;","tha-ap25:16.3":"So me dhammamadesesi, saraṇañca adāsi me.","tha-ap25:17.1":"“Sohaṃ sutvāna saraṇaṃ, saraṇaṃ me anussariṃ;","tha-ap25:17.3":"Ekāsane nisīditvā, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap25:18.1":"“Jātiyā sattame vasse, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","tha-ap25:18.3":"Upasampādayi buddho, guṇamaññāya cakkhumā.","tha-ap25:19.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, saraṇāni agacchahaṃ;","tha-ap25:19.3":"Tato me sukataṃ kammaṃ, phalaṃ dassesi me idha.","tha-ap25:20.1":"“Sugopitaṃ me saraṇaṃ, mānasaṃ suppaṇīhitaṃ;","tha-ap25:20.3":"Anubhotvā yasaṃ sabbaṃ, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap25:21.1":"“Yesaṃ sotāvadhānatthi, suṇotha mama bhāsato;","tha-ap25:21.3":"Ahaṃ [atthaṃ (syā.)] vo kathayissāmi, sāmaṃ diṭṭhaṃ padaṃ mama.","tha-ap25:22.1":"“‘Buddho loke samuppanno, vattate jinasāsanaṃ;","tha-ap25:22.3":"Amatā vāditā bherī, sokasallavinodanā.","tha-ap25:23.1":"“‘Yathāsakena thāmena, puññakkhette anuttare;","tha-ap25:23.3":"Adhikāraṃ kareyyātha, passayissatha nibbutiṃ.","tha-ap25:24.1":"“‘Paggayha tīṇi saraṇe, pañcasīlāni gopiya;","tha-ap25:24.3":"Buddhe cittaṃ pasādetvā, dukkhassantaṃ karissatha.","tha-ap25:25.1":"“‘Sammā dhammaṃ bhāvetvāna [mamopamaṃ karitvāna (sī. syā.)], sīlāni parigopiya;","tha-ap25:25.3":"Aciraṃ arahattaṃ vo, sabbepi pāpuṇissatha.","tha-ap25:26.1":"“‘Tevijjo iddhipattomhi, cetopariyakovido;","tha-ap25:26.3":"Sāvako te mahāvīra, saraṇo [caraṇe (sī. syā.)] vandati satthuno’.","tha-ap25:27.1":"“Aparimeyye ito kappe, saraṇaṃ buddhassa gacchahaṃ;","tha-ap25:27.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, saraṇaṃ gamane phalaṃ.","tha-ap25:28.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap25:28.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap25:29.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tisaraṇagamaniyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap25:30.1":"Tisaraṇagamaniyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2352,"to":2354,"paras":[{"para":2352,"vripara":"106","refs":["tha-ap25:1"],"lines":["So arahattappatto upasampanno hutvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassavasena pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>nagare bandhumatiyā</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>mātu upaṭṭhāko ahun</b>ti ahaṃ mātāpitūnaṃ upaṭṭhāko bharako bandhumatīnagare ahosinti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap25:1"],["tha-ap25:1"]]},{"para":2353,"vripara":"108","refs":["tha-ap25:3"],"lines":["<b>Tamandhakārapihitā</b>ti mohandhakārena pihitā chāditā.","<b>Tividhaggīhi ḍayhare</b>ti rāgaggidosaggimohaggisaṅkhātehi tīhi aggīhi ḍayhare ḍayhanti sabbe sattāti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap25:3"],["tha-ap25:3"]]},{"para":2354,"vripara":"114","refs":["tha-ap25:9"],"lines":["<b>Aṭṭha hetū labhāmahan</b>ti aṭṭha kāraṇāni sukhassa paccayabhūtāni kāraṇāni labhāmi ahanti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap25:9"],["tha-ap25:9"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap25:1.1","mātu upaṭṭhāko ahuṃ",0,1],["tha-ap25:3.1","tividhaggīhi ḍayhare",1,1],["tha-ap25:9.3","aṭṭha hetū labhāmahaṃ",2,0]]},"tika":null}
